        "stdout": "rc=1\nrc=1\nrc=2\n",
        "stderr": "bash: line 1: shopt: bogus: invalid shell option name\nbash: line 1: shopt: cannot set and unset shell options simultaneously\nbash: line 1: shopt: -z: invalid option\nshopt: usage: shopt [-pqsu] [-o] [optname ...]\n"
      }
    },
